{"author":{"id":"bc879001b271aeebdd38a690df6011bef3fd316a5680eda2689f43e26c43d0a4"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1795254051,"nonce":"JgBMS3ExlAHqGwTbUJSs9LD3PUY=","title":"Node variables passed through WITH, and WHERE after WITH","message":"At 81bb070:\n\n- `MATCH (p:Person) WITH p RETURN p.name` fails with `Runtime(\"variable index 1 out of range\")`; so does `MATCH (p:Person) WITH p WHERE p.name = 'Bob' RETURN p.id` and `UNWIND $names AS w MATCH (p:Person) WITH p, w WHERE p.name = w RETURN p.id`. A node variable projected by WITH carries no property columns for the next part to resolve.\n- `MATCH (p:Person) WITH p.name AS name WHERE name = 'Bob' RETURN name` returns both rows: the WHERE attached to WITH is not applied.\n\nFound while fixing 5c51558; reproduce with the `people(false)` fixture in kyu-api's connection tests.","files":null}]}